Third-party code named in the author's comments, and what is known of its terms:
  - smin / smax: Inigo Quilez. iquilezles.org says its code snippets are under the
    MIT licence.
  - pModPolar: hg_sdf by Mercury (https://mercury.sexy/hg_sdf/), which its page
    says is dual-licensed "MIT OR CC-BY-NC-4.0" (since 2021-07-28).
  - N31: see the note on Dave Hoskins' hash above.
Each is a few lines and is kept exactly as the author wrote it.
